@startuml
title PostProc-1 — экспорт результатов и сетки
top to bottom direction
scale max 1500 width
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 14
skinparam ranksep 18
hide empty members

interface IResultsExporter
interface IResultsExportSaver
interface IGridExporter
interface IGridSurfacesSaver
class ResultsExporter
class SaveObjectsResultsToTXT
class SaveObjectsResultsToCSV
class GridExporter
class SaveGridSurfacesToBPF
abstract class SaveGridSurfacesToSTLBase
class SaveGridSurfacesToBinSTL
class SaveGridSurfacesToTxtSTL

IResultsExporter <|.. ResultsExporter
IResultsExportSaver <|.. SaveObjectsResultsToTXT
IResultsExportSaver <|.. SaveObjectsResultsToCSV
ResultsExporter ..> IResultsExportSaver : выбирает по формату
IGridExporter <|.. GridExporter
IGridSurfacesSaver <|.. SaveGridSurfacesToBPF
IGridSurfacesSaver <|.. SaveGridSurfacesToSTLBase
SaveGridSurfacesToSTLBase <|-- SaveGridSurfacesToBinSTL
SaveGridSurfacesToSTLBase <|-- SaveGridSurfacesToTxtSTL
GridExporter ..> IGridSurfacesSaver : выбирает по формату
@enduml
